Package: taxifydb
Title: Build Backbones and Enrichments for the 'taxify' Package
Version: 0.1.16
Authors@R:
    person("Gilles", "Colling", , "gilles.colling051@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-3070-6066"))
Description: Build pipeline for the 'taxify' package. Downloads raw source
    data from official providers (WFO, COL, GBIF, ITIS, NCBI Taxonomy, Open
    Tree of Life, WoRMS, Euro+Med PlantBase, Index Fungorum, AlgaeBase,
    FishBase, SeaLifeBase, the Reptile Database, the World Checklist of
    Vascular Plants, and the Leipzig Catalogue of Vascular Plants) and a wide
    set of trait and conservation datasets, normalizes to a unified Darwin
    Core-like schema, and writes pre-compiled '.vtr' files that the 'taxify'
    runtime consumes. Separates build-time concerns (network access, parsing,
    schema normalization) from runtime concerns so that 'taxify' itself stays
    lean.
